{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And Bethuel begot Rebekah.</b> Scripture does not mention Laban and his mother, even though he is older than Rebekah, because it did not come to mention except the eight whom Milcah bore to Nahor. But it mentioned Rebekah because this passage comes to make known her lineage. The reason for \"the father of Aram\" — Scripture mentioned Aram only to make known and identify Kemuel, because Aram was more distinguished than his father. Or perhaps Kemuel was a different person in their generation, and this one is the father of Aram."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:33:15.431037126Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}